§ APOCRYPHA-COMPETITIVE-FULL-APP-ROADMAP v1  ‼
§ owner := Apocky
§ created := 2026-09-12 America/Phoenix
§ authority := direct.user.goal«Get Apocrypha competitive with Codex, GPT, Grok, Gemini, Claude, Kimi, DeepSeek, etc. but better»
§ execution := one feature → focused tests → integration → live signed-in user-flow oracle → commit → push → remote tree readback → next

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
§ OBJECTIVE + PRODUCT DECISION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

objective := Apocrypha = sovereign.provider-neutral.agent-runtime + complete.consumer/work/coding.app
             ⊗ parity.table-stakes ⊗ measurable.superiority.on-proof+continuity+authority+memory+routing

⌈DECISION-1⌉ Apocrypha owns product identity + web/mobile/desktop experience.
⌈DECISION-2⌉ prior Mycelium design (`specs/grand-vision/23_MYCELIUM_DESKTOP.csl`) becomes
             Apocrypha.desktop-runtime architecture; ¬ separate competing product.
⌈DECISION-3⌉ “reverse engineer” = inspect public documented/observable behavior + build original equivalent/better behavior;
             N! copy proprietary code | prompts | secrets | protected assets | bypass access controls.
⌈DECISION-4⌉ Apocrypha does not need to out-train every frontier lab. It routes local+hosted models and
             owns continuity, tools, memory, authority, verification, artifacts, and interface.

success :=
  S1 complete.capability.denominator has owner+dependency+oracle+status ∀ row
  S2 each implemented feature passes destination live-effect oracle ¬ proxy-only
  S3 superiority claims exist only after matched external benchmark beats named baseline

non_goals := marketing.superiority.without-benchmark | hardcoded-single-provider | big-bang-rewrite |
             destructive migration | silent authority expansion | test-green-as-live-completion

