legend := ✓ observed.current-source/test | ◐ inferred-from-✓ | ○ reported/prior-receipt |
          ◇ proposed | ? unknown | ✗ contradicted
status := pending | active | verified | failed | blocked | unknown

W! vendor.matrix keyed-by {model, API, consumer-app, coding-harness, managed-agent-platform, enterprise}
W! availability tagged {GA, rollout, beta, preview, deprecated} + plan/region/account/device
N! whole-vendor OR-aggregation | nominal-context⇒usable-context | citations⇒correctness |
   approval-UX⇒enforcement | agent-count⇒quality | file-export⇒native-roundtrip-editing

